(1, 'Apple MacBook Pro 16 (Creator Edition)', 3106.47, 2632.6, 1, 'apple_macbook.png', 1, GETDATE(), 'Admin', 'Engineered for high efficiency and productivity, the Apple MacBook Pro 16 (Creator Edition) stands as a powerhouse in portable computing. Equipped with the advanced M3 Pro CPU, 48GB RAM, and 1TB SSD SSD storage, this laptop handles multi-threaded applications and virtualization without breaking a sweat. It also features a stunning 16.2" 2560x1664 screen with Apple 18-Core GPU graphics for rich and crisp display output.', 'Apple 18-Core GPU', '1TB SSD', 1, 'M3 Pro', 48, '2560x1664', '16.2', '1.61 kg', 3),
