(3, 'Apple MacBook Pro 16 (Creator Edition v2)', 3178.21, 2693.4, 1, 'apple_macbook.png', 1, GETDATE(), 'Admin', 'Uncompromising speed and gorgeous design define the Apple MacBook Pro 16 (Creator Edition v2). Perfect for creative workloads, software engineering, and high-performance computing, it packs a M1 Pro processor, 8GB of RAM, and 4TB SSD of storage. Enjoy immersive graphics on the 15.3" display at 2880x1864 resolution powered by Apple 40-Core GPU graphics. Ideal for power users who demand the best.', 'Apple 40-Core GPU', '4TB SSD', 1, 'M1 Pro', 8, '2880x1864', '15.3', '1.51 kg', 3),
